# ml/ environment variables — copy to ml/.env and fill in. Never commit
# the real ml/.env file (already covered by the root .gitignore's .env
# pattern).

# --- ml/rag/ingest (USDA FoodData Central) ---
# Free registration at https://api.data.gov/signup/ — DEMO_KEY (the
# default if unset) hits USDA's rate limit almost immediately.
# USDA_API_KEY=

# --- ml/rag/ingest (PubMed/NCBI E-utilities, optional) ---
# Raises the unauthenticated 3 req/sec limit; not required for the
# default topic list in ml/rag/ingest/topics.py.
# NCBI_API_KEY=
